# Fixture-specific overrides for the repository's `* text=auto eol=lf` rule.
#
# `src/corrupt.rs` deliberately contains bytes that are not valid UTF-8. It is the file that used to
# abort a whole Cortex index, and the test that asserts it no longer does depends on those exact
# bytes surviving the round trip. `text=auto` classifies a file as binary by looking for NUL bytes,
# and this file has none, so without this line git would treat it as text and is free to rewrite it
# on any future commit.
mixed/src/corrupt.rs -text
